{"id":72784,"date":"2026-11-04T08:38:28","date_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:38:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72784"},"modified":"2026-11-04T09:43:58","modified_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:43:58","slug":"trail-da-loba","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-da-loba\/","title":{"rendered":"9\u00ba Trail da Loba 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">9\u00ba Trail da Loba 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>9\u00ba Trail da Loba 2027<\/strong> (9\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>24 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, com partida marcada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> na freguesia de <strong>Rio de Loba<\/strong>, no concelho e distrito de <strong>Viseu<\/strong>. J\u00e1 consolidado como uma das cl\u00e1ssicas provas de inverno da Beira Alta, o evento desafia os atletas a percorrer os trilhos naturais que envolvem as colinas e cursos de \u00e1gua da periferia oriental viseense.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo adapta-se a diferentes n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica e t\u00e9cnica, disponibilizando quatro percursos distintos pelos caminhos rurais, bosques de pinhal e <em>single tracks<\/em> de <strong>Rio de Loba<\/strong>: o exigente <strong>Trail Longo de 30 km<\/strong>, o <strong>Trail Curto de 15 km<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini-Trail de 10 km<\/strong> para inicia\u00e7\u00e3o ao trail running e uma <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> de cariz l\u00fadico aberta a toda a comunidade.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Rio de Loba<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong>Centro Social Cultural Recreativo e Desportivo Le\u00f5es da Beira (CSCRD Le\u00f5es da Beira)<\/strong> e apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Viseu<\/strong>, o evento mant\u00e9m a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o de hospitalidade beir\u00e3, disponibilizando op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no final para atletas e acompanhantes. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; backg